+    // write, computeFlagLiveness): then the deferred-flag locals need not be kept, and the whole op
+    // is what the operation actually is -- get, get, op, set. The staging below exists ONLY so that
+    // {op1, op2, res} survive for a later materialisation; emitting it anyway cost 6 of the 10 wasm
